    VALA @ smile "도서관에서 밤을 새기로 할 경우를 대비해 내가 설치해 둔 거야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_AltInvestigation.rpy:870
translate kr qst_TheComingStorm_GetToValaSneak_Arrived_d60e0f89:

    # VALA @ talk "You'll be able to lay low there... for now."
    VALA @ talk "거기서 몸을 숨길 수 있을 거야... 당분간은."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_AltInvestigation.rpy:877
translate kr qst_TheComingStorm_GetToValaSneak_Arrived_914075d6:

    # MC @ serious "How do I know this isn't just another ruse?"
    MC @ serious "이게 또 다른 책략이 아니란 걸 어떻게 알아?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_AltInvestigation.rpy:879
translate kr qst_TheComingStorm_GetToValaSneak_Arrived_c75d953a:

    # VALA @ talk "You don't, and you'd be correct not to fully trust me."
    VALA @ talk "그래, 그리고 날 완전히 믿지 않는 게 맞아."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_AltInvestigation.rpy:880
translate kr qst_TheComingStorm_GetToValaSneak_Arrived_7a6dc5e0:

    # VALA @ talk "...But whether you trust me or not, I believe {i}you{/i} are going to be needed for whatever is to come."
    VALA @ talk "...하지만 너가 나를 믿든 말든, 나는 {i}네가{/i} 앞으로 닥칠 일에 필요할 거라고 믿어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_AltInvestigation.rpy:881
translate kr qst_TheComingStorm_GetToValaSneak_Arrived_49393759:

    # VALA @ talk "Now, there's a small wash bowl in the room, I suggest you use it."
    VALA @ talk "자, 방에 작은 세숫대야가 있어, 쓰는 게 좋을 거야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_AltInvestigation.rpy:882
translate kr qst_TheComingStorm_GetToValaSneak_Arrived_ee81c4ac:

    # VALA @ talk "You smell rather... {i}Unpleasant.{/i}"
    VALA @ talk "냄새가 꽤... {i}불쾌하군.{/i}"

